-------------------------

- internal/supply/trusted_root.json: public Sigstore trust material from
  https://github.com/sigstore/root-signing, retrieved on 19 November 2026.
  tools/imageverify/testdata/: recorded public verification fixtures from
  sigstore-go v1.4.0, https://github.com/sigstore/sigstore-go, Copyright the
  Sigstore Authors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  The cosign-oci-v0.3.json and cosign-trusted-root.json fixtures come from
  cosign v3.1.1, https://github.com/sigstore/cosign, under the same licence.

- Release runtime files: Firecracker v1.18.0
  (https://github.com/firecracker-microvm/firecracker), Copyright Amazon.com,
  Inc. or its affiliates, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  The raw executables and source are mirrored without changes. The upstream
  licence, NOTICE and dependency notices are in third-party-licences/firecracker-*.

Code or data adapted from other open-source projects is listed here, with its
licence and the files it appears in.

- internal/agents/rules/*.toml: screen-rule patterns adapted from Herdr's agent
  detection manifests (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr, src/detect/manifests),
  Copyright the Herdr authors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  The rule format and engine are our own; the patterns were simplified.

- vt/src/snapshot.zig: the approach to serialising terminal state is adapted
  from zmx's serializeTerminalState (https://github.com/neurosnap/zmx,
